d 'TVTHRESH': module to estimate time-varying threshold models and tests 
d
d  Threshold regression normally assumes the threshold is the same
d for every observation. tvthresh is for the case where it is not.
d It provides nineteen commands covering specification testing,
d estimation, simulation, plotting and table output. The gateway
d command tvthomog tests whether the threshold is constant at all,
d so a user can find out whether any of this is needed before
d fitting anything. If it is, the estimators cover the four ways a
d threshold can move: with time (tvtfourier, tvtlasso), with the
d threshold variable's own recent past (tvtcotar, tvtcotrk, and
d tvtinar for counts), with other observed variables (tvtcoint,
d tvtboundary, tvtindex, tvtstar, tvtcovdep), and as an unobserved
d state of its own (tvtlatent). tvtsel runs the library's
d diagnostics on the user's data and reports which specifications
d they point to. 
d
d KW: threshold models
d KW: tests 
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261018
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f tvtboundary.ado
